{"id":"mandarin-advanced-opening-r1","requestedModel":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","requestedProvider":"google-ai-studio","httpStatus":200,"metadata":{"id":"gen-1789878298-rPJziSG2rXgGEmC0VKmX","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","provider":"[omitted: unreviewed or content-bearing metadata]","created":1789878298,"system_fingerprint":null,"usage":{"prompt_tokens":778,"completion_tokens":1154,"total_tokens":1932,"cost":0.004911,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.004911,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.0005835,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0043275},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1026,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}},"finishReason":"stop","nativeFinishReason":"STOP","omittedFields":["provider","service_tier"]},"content":"刚才收工穿过老城区，看到一家招牌字都掉了一半的小店门口坐满了人，隔壁新开、装修得极素雅的茶饮空间反倒冷冷清清。我向来有个偏见，总觉得门面越破烂、越不懂营销的店，手艺往往越扎实，甚至快把“环境简陋”当成某种品质背书了。但仔细琢磨，这种把市井气等同于真材实料的心态，究竟是真有经验依据，还是被我们一厢情愿地浪漫化了？","status":"complete","invitationFailures":[],"elapsedMs":5929}
{"id":"mandarin-advanced-opening-r2","requestedModel":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","requestedProvider":"google-ai-studio","httpStatus":200,"metadata":{"id":"gen-1789878304-GisFbKboSpZSzjPKSqyn","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","provider":"[omitted: unreviewed or content-bearing metadata]","created":1789878304,"system_fingerprint":null,"usage":{"prompt_tokens":778,"completion_tokens":172,"total_tokens":950,"cost":0.0012285,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.0012285,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.0005835,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.000645},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}},"finishReason":"stop","nativeFinishReason":"STOP","omittedFields":["provider","service_tier"]},"content":"刚才收工路过玉林那边的一家二手旧书摊，随手翻到一本九十年代的科幻中篇集，纸页都发脆了。里面有个故事设想未来的人类把所有关于“等待”的感知都通过神经芯片切除了，比如等车、等水烧开，或者等一个人的回信，全都能瞬间跳过。\n\n我站在路灯底下琢磨了半天，总觉得这种设定挺让人毛骨悚然的。哪怕有时候干等着确实折磨人，但要是把这种空隙全抽掉，生活好像就只剩下一个接一个的结果了。\n\n换作是你，如果真有这么个开关，你会想把日常里哪种特定的“等待”彻底删掉吗，还是宁可原样留着？","status":"complete","invitationFailures":[],"elapsedMs":1969}
